#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/lift_gamma_gain.rst:42
msgid ""
"This effect/filter allows you to adjust the lift (impacting mainly shadows), "
"gain (impacting mainly highlights) and :term:`gamma` (impacting mainly "
"midtones). The color wheel inputs allow to control the degree to which these "
"effects apply to the R, G & B color channels. By default, the white color at "
"the centre of the color wheel is selected, meaning the effect applies "
"equally to all three color channels. By choosing another color on the color "
"wheel, the effect will be applied on the R, G & B channels in proportion to "
"the RGB components that make up that color."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter umožňuje upraviť lift (ovplyvňuje hlavne tiene), gain "
"(ovplyvňuje hlavne svetlé časti) a :term:`gamu` (ovplyvňuje hlavne "
"polotóny). Vstupy farebného kolesa umožňujú ovládať mieru, do akej sa tieto "
"efekty aplikujú na farebné kanály R, G a B. Predvolene je vybraná biela "
"farba v strede farebného kolesa, čo znamená, že efekt sa aplikuje rovnomerne "
"na všetky tri farebné kanály. Výberom inej farby na farebnom kolese sa efekt "
"aplikuje na kanály R, G a B v pomere zodpovedajúcom ich RGB komponentom "
"danej farby."

